  "title": "Melitzanosalata Agioritiki (Athenian Eggplant Salad)",
  "description": "This melitzanosalata agioritiki (Athenian eggplant salad) recipe uses eggplant, tomato, onion, parsley, and feta cheese. It's refreshing and smoky flavored.",
